<title>Iraq: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/iraq/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-iraq-2026-11-14T06:49:14.429Z</guid>
<pubDate>Sat, 14 Nov 2026 06:49:14 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Iran-backed suspects are accused of planning attacks on a U.K. air base that hosts U.S. jets in Iraq, while an Iran-backed trio is linked to a drone strike that disabled the Khor Mor gas field in Iraqi Kurdistan. Iraqi security officials have expanded air-defence deployments, created a special security force and an energy police unit to protect pipelines and curb oil smuggling, and are sending a delegation to Lebanon to assist the inquiry into former MP Ahmed al-Alwani’s death. The conflict remains low-level but sees coordinated Iranian proxy actions against both military and energy targets, and a new diplomatic outreach to Lebanon. 396 battle-related deaths were recorded in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.washingtonpost.com/politics/2026/11/13/trump-falsely-claims-nobodys-been-killed-iran-war-last-five-months/&quot;&gt;The Washington Post&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMihwFBVV95cUxNRHBIeDZtZmYySmEtWjhlalVOTnpNVXQtcEhvWlJqcFJLQ0lUYWh4RVVuN0JMZGV6M2kzVzlrWDFOVVpQZDVkakt0bzlsVWdwZ2VVR0lVcUhLTm1LZlMySC0td3RlNUZqVzBGVGVSZXNxdVoyQ2FwdlFOYXpMQ2FGUTRNWHZVR2M?oc=5&quot;&gt;The New York Times&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMixAFBVV95cUxOTDByV0JBRWNIZjRYb2ZsT0cxTWdSaG5wV0lDTVRmb0dhRGpWbW5RUnd3anJBZnc0S2xielBSbVNGNUZYU0hvTDVKZHNTNjNyc25wVUhhcDU2a2duZ3FMbXpJNGhxV3RPNVpXT3dDcm91NUlhRjFyNE5MVEFmQzJpUjF1dE5Uek9oYTVwZnpfY2FSQWFwVXNMcUJTV1BDN3R5X2UzZ3hGbVZPVkN2QjRCeHFielRXempUTHh1Nm1jbkNCUU5I?oc=5&quot;&gt;France 24&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Haaretz&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description>
